[font_size=36]0.0.2.1 - Hotfixiest Hotfix of 2026[/font_size]
[font_size=25]Additions[/font_size]
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]fuzzy[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]the dud[/color]"
Added new feature: Discord RPC!!!
* Discord now shows when you play, what challenge you're playing, and stuff like that. pretty cool!

[font_size=25]Changes[/font_size]
[color=9ff]keep track !![/color]: now has a short description and a proper extended description.
[color=9ff]eeeror[/color]: now has a proper extended description.
[color=9ff]i poisoned this fork with c4[/color]: now has a proper extended description.
[color=9ff]Voodoo[/color]: actually fucking works
[color=9ff]the SUPERHOT hourglass[/color]: slows down the timer sooner
[color=9ff]D20[/color]: Now limits the reroll tokens you can get to 1
Nerfed the "SPEEEEDRUN" challenge.
* Rounds 15 -> 14
Timer now speeds up its countdown overtime when counting reroll tickets
Explosions can now only kill up to 5 barts. (used in [color=9ff]bart mine[/color], [color=9ff]glass cannon[/color], etc.)


[font_size=25]Bugfixes[/font_size]
Reroll tokens now properly get given every 10 seconds left rather than every 9

[font_size=36]0.0.2.0 - worst day of nilcysts life![/font_size]
[font_size=25]Additions[/font_size]
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]glass cannon[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]ti tel bar[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]Coin Hack!![/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]Voodoo[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]D20[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]bart esp[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]double double a battery(s(z))[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]i poisoned this fork with c4[/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]keep track !![/color]"
Added new thing: "[color=9ff]eeeror[/color]"
Added new feature: autoclicker detection.
* If the game detects an autoclicker, any input will be blocked until you quit to the title screen.
There is now a retry option for game over prompts.
You can now fullscreen the game by pressing Alt + Enter, F11 or the F key.
The game over screen now shows what you died to.
You can now reroll in the Intermission if you have time left over, every 10 seconds turning into an extra reroll.

[font_size=25]Changes[/font_size]
[color=9ff]DVD VIDEO LOGO!![/color]: The cooldown indicator indicates how close it is to being off of cooldown
[color=9ff]Blink[/color]: There's now a 15% chance for a bart to teleport and a 15% chance for it to only change direction, unlike it teleporting barts with a 100% chance.
[color=9ff]Nilcyst[/color]: Nilcyst now disappears and reappears at random points on the screen rather than remaining stationary, reducing visual clutter.
[color=9ff]EVENT HORIZON[/color]: Updated the icon.
Volume set in the title screen is now properly saved and loaded.
The "choose an good :)" image for intermissions was changed from green to pink to accurately reflect the color palette of good things.
Made [color=9ff]OSU IN ARKANSAS[/color] a thing obtainable in the "Awesome Combo!" challenge.
Nerfed "[color=9ff]Umer[/color]".
Rebalanced some challenges.

[font_size=25]Bugfixes[/font_size]
Fixed a bug regarding good things that require bad things not loading (and vice versa). This issue affected "[color=9ff]cyst charm[/color]", "[color=9ff]ti tel bar[/color]" and "[color=9ff]OSU IN ARKANSAS[/color]"
Fixed a bug regarding [color=9ff]ARRAY OF CHAIN ARRAYS[/color] adding entities that are banned by the challenge/not unlocked yet
- Removed Herobrine

[font_size=36]0.0.1.4 - poop patch[/font_size]
[font_size=25]Additions[/font_size]
Added new feature: custom backgrounds and songs for the "Green Demon" challenge.
Added new images for the "Choose an ___" text in the intermission for Predetermined and Hidden things.

[font_size=25]Changes[/font_size]
Nerfed the "Flomer challenge" challenge.
Nerfed "[color=9ff]Umer[/color]".
[color=9ff]the marges[/color]: Reworked; Instead of having to stop your mouse as they disappear, you now have to keep your mouse still for 0.4 seconds while she's in the red state, or else you get a game over.

[font_size=25]Bugfixes[/font_size]
Fixed a bug regarding the way clicking was checked for in the "[color=9ff]click the bart[/color]"/"[color=9ff]osu[/color]" thing, which could cause the game to crash.


